---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Stack · machinedi" description="Tools Edi Rodin actually uses." unlisted>
  <h1>Stack</h1>
  <div class="page-intro">
    <p>Tools I actually use. This list will stay short.</p>
  </div>
  <ul class="stack-list">
    <li>
      <span class="label">Python</span>
      <span class="hint">Scripts, local tools, and most of the systems work.</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="label">MCP</span>
      <span class="hint">Connecting tools to agents without extra ceremony.</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="label">Local agents</span>
      <span class="hint">Gated, inspectable, and only in the loop when I open the gate.</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="label">Astro</span>
      <span class="hint">This site. Markdown in, static pages out.</span>
    </li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>
